cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use qualitative-qsim in research, please cite the software using this metadata. A JOSS article citation will replace it after publication."
type: software
title: "qualitative-qsim: Qualitative reasoning about dynamical systems"
abstract: >-
  A Python and PyTorch library for QSIM-style qualitative simulation,
  semi-quantitative refinement, numeric-trajectory abstraction and coverage,
  temporal guidance, diagnosis, decomposition, model induction, and related
  qualitative analyses of dynamical systems.
authors:
  - family-names: Oursland
    given-names: Alan
version: 0.1.0a0
repository-code: "https://github.com/alanoursland/qualitative_reasoning_lib"
url: "https://github.com/alanoursland/qualitative_reasoning_lib"
keywords:
  - qualitative reasoning
  - qualitative simulation
  - QSIM
  - qualitative differential equations
  - dynamical systems
  - PyTorch
